# Extension Build Workflow

## Regular Changes (non-publish)

When making changes to the extension:
- Run `npm run compile` in the extension folder
- Run `vsce package` to produce the .vsix
- **Keep the same version and file name** (overwrites existing .vsix, e.g. `yms-zendoc-0.1.7.vsix`)

## Publish Only

When the user explicitly asks to **publish** the extension:
- Bump the version in `package.json`
- Compile and package to the new file name (e.g. `yms-zendoc-0.1.8.vsix`)
